isStronglyCM -- Checks if the given ideal is Strongly Cohen Macaulay
********************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        b = isStronglyCM I
  * Inputs:
      * I, an *note ideal: (Macaulay2Doc)Ideal,, 
  * Outputs:
      * b, a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, true if I is Strongly
        Cohen Macaulay

Description
===========

I is Strongly Cohen Macaulay if each Koszul homology module is Cohen-Macaulay.
The routine computes the Koszul homology with koszulDepth.

+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = ZZ/101[x_1..x_5];                              |
+--------------------------------------------------------+
